// KR-198: in a build of two modules, an `InlineArray` size refused while the program's instances are collected
// named no file (`:4:24: error: …`), because that pass sets no module path. The second module is what makes the
// build multi-file.
type value Big { public InlineArray<int32>#(0) a; }
fn uint8 main() { return 0; }
